Zero point energy                ...      0.25632812 Eh     160.85 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01832643 Eh      11.50 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
